        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.0928649902344,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "towards reduced death rates in children treated with amoxicillin plus gentamicin,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        170.2628936767578,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "but this was not significant.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        97.26070404052734,
        163.95286560058594,
        109.25070190429688
      ],
      "text": "6.4.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        112.9054183959961,
        88.77290344238281,
        125.04541778564453
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        125.91542053222656,
        399.1128845214844,
        139.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "Combination beta-lactam plus gentamicin reduces failure rates and may reduce",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        138.91542053222656,
        145.43289184570312,
        152.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "pneumonia mortality.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        160.4093017578125,
        78.65290069580078,
        172.54930114746094
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        322.2398986816406,
        173.1992950439453,
        368.1799011230469,
        186.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "section 6.2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        173.41929626464844,
        399.1198425292969,
        186.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "Side effects/toxicity of recommended antibiotics as outlined in   in the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        186.28929138183594,
        263.8133850097656,
        199.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "Model Formulary for Children WHO   [WHO 2010].",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        210.93788146972656,
        205.31298828125,
        222.92788696289062
      ],
      "text": "6.4.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        226.59251403808594,
        399.10272216796875,
        240.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "Value was placed on reduction in failure rates and likely reduction in mortality with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        239.59251403808594,
        399.1527404785156,
        253.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "beta-lactam and gentamicin combination. All drugs are in the Essential Medicines",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        252.59251403808594,
        399.0528869628906,
        266.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "for Children List. Ampicillin, gentamicin and chloramphenicol are the currently",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        265.5924987792969,
        326.86297607421875,
        279.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "recommended options for management of very severe pneumonia.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        278.5924987792969,
        399.13165283203125,
        292.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "Ampicillin and gentamicin are more expensive per dose than chloramphenicol.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        291.5924987792969,
        300.1728820800781,
        305.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "Median price [Management Science for Health/WHO 2010]:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        304.5924987792969,
        225.74151611328125,
        318.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "—\t Ampicillin 250 mg: US$ 0.1786/vial",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        317.5924987792969,
        235.9515380859375,
        331.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "—\t Gentamicin 10mg/ml: US$ 0.0665/ml",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        330.5924987792969,
        236.38153076171875,
        344.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "—\t Chloramphenicol 1 g: US$ 0.3600/vial",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        354.1401062011719,
        340.7239074707031,
        367.3291015625
      ],
      "text": "6.5\t Salbutamol for treatment of acute wheeze/asthma and",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        367.1401062011719,
        181.3376922607422,
        380.3291015625
      ],
      "text": "bronchoconstriction",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        383.7657775878906,
        399.0828552246094,
        397.25579833984375
      ],
      "text": "a)\t Children with acute wheeze/asthma and bronchoconstriction should be treated",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        396.7657775878906,
        399.04144287109375,
        410.25579833984375
      ],
      "text": "with inhaled salbutamol using a metered dose inhaler (MDI) with spacer devices",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        409.7657775878906,
        194.79150390625,
        423.25579833984375
      ],
      "text": "to relieve bronchoconstriction.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        425.17041015625,
        252.91282653808594,
        439.0904235839844
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        441.43499755859375,
        399.09295654296875,
        454.9250183105469
      ],
      "text": "b)\tOral salbutamol should not be used for treatment of acute or persistent wheeze",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        454.43499755859375,
        399.0212097167969,
        467.9250183105469
      ],
      "text": "except where inhaled salbutamol is not available but has no utility in testing",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        467.43499755859375,
        188.05152893066406,
        480.9250183105469
      ],
      "text": "response to a bronchodilator.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        482.8396911621094,
        252.91282653808594,
        496.75970458984375
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        510.6228942871094,
        233.98292541503906,
        522.6129150390625
      ],
      "text": "6.5.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        526.277587890625,
        399.05279541015625,
        539.767578125
      ],
      "text": "The panel identified a review undertaken for the Expert Committee on the Selection",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        539.277587890625,
        399.07281494140625,
        552.767578125
      ],
      "text": "and Use of Essential Medicines 2008, focusing on whether oral salbutamol should",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        552.277587890625,
        399.11279296875,
        565.767578125
      ],
      "text": "remain on the WHO Paediatric Model List [Sani, 2008]. The review identified five",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        565.277587890625,
        399.0928955078125,
        578.767578125
      ],
      "text": "studies comparing lung function tests of asthmatics treated with oral, inhaled,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        578.277587890625,
        399.1029357910156,
        591.767578125
      ],
      "text": "or combination oral and inhaled salbutamol. Most studies showed that inhaled",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        591.277587890625,
        399.0729675292969,
        604.767578125
      ],
      "text": "salbutamol was superior in improving lung function, was effective at lower doses, and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        604.277587890625,
        399.0729064941406,
        617.767578125
      ],
      "text": "therefore caused fewer side effects than oral salbutamol. However, oral salbutamol",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.3668975830078,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.6739044189453,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "46",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}